## Top-level layout

```
README.md                       Orientation — what this repo is.
CLAUDE.md                       This file. The schema.
ROADMAP.md                      Themes, parallel streams, checkpoints.
architecture.md                 Current target architecture, ~1 page.
.forge.config.yaml              Forge config (tracker, scm, streams, roles, integrations).
decisions/                      ADRs — one per major architectural call. Append-only. Supersede, don't rewrite. Each links its tracker ticket.
tribal/                         Hard-won knowledge: gotchas, novel-bug fixes, env quirks, "looks-wrong-but-intentional". The *how*.
services/                       One page per service.
themes/                         Theme pages with checkpoints, tickets, owner stream.
roles/                          Role definitions (loaded by /prime).
.claude/skills/                 Project-scoped skills: prime, dispatch, wiki.
```

